# UC-004 — Get customer by id

Consolidated spec, **short path**. Recipient: `java-spring-boot-developer`.

No partials `10-` through `40-`: every decision below is either reused from an approved
spec or fixed by a rule. Nothing here was decided by judgment.

| Short-path criterion | Evidence |
|---|---|
| Aggregate reused from an approved spec | `Customer` — `UC-001-create-customer`, `status: implemented` |
| No new table, column, or migration | reads `customers` by PK |
| No new exception | not found → the existing `NotFoundException` family, `errorCode` `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` already in `UC-001` |
| No question asked to the user | `00-use-case.md` answered from the request and the approved specs |

